Package: fosos-installer
Version: 1.0.5
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: calamares, squashfs-tools, rsync, grub-efi-amd64, grub-efi-amd64-bin, grub-efi-amd64-signed, shim-signed, mokutil, grub2-common, grub-common, efibootmgr, cryptsetup, cryptsetup-initramfs, dosfstools, os-prober, pkexec, sudo, qt6-qpa-plugins, qt6-gtk-platformtheme, qt6-svg-plugins, x11-xserver-utils
Maintainer: FosOS <dev@fosos.local>
Description: FosOS graphical installer
 Calamares configuration and branding for installing FosOS.
 Covers partitioning, optional disk encryption, locale, timezone,
 keyboard, and the account that will own the installed system.
 Ensures the live squashfs is visible at the path Calamares expects
 (/run/live/medium) even when live-boot mounted the USB elsewhere.
 Installs Debian-signed shim/GRUB so the target can boot with Secure Boot.
